  "full_response": "**[Your Full Name]**\n[Your Job Title]\n[Your Company/Organization Name]\n[Your Company Address]\n[City, State, ZIP Code]\n[Your Email Address]\n[Your Phone Number]\n[Date]\n\n**To Whom It May Concern,**\n\nI am pleased to write this letter of recommendation for **[Applicant’s Full Name]**, who has been employed at **[Current Employer’s Name]** as a **[Applicant’s Job Title]** since **[Start Date, if known]**. It has been a privilege to work with [Applicant’s First Name], and I am confident in their abilities, professionalism, and dedication to their work.\n\nDuring [Applicant’s First Name]’s tenure at **[Current Employer’s Name]**, they have consistently demonstrated **[mention key skills, e.g., strong leadership, problem-solving abilities, teamwork, or technical expertise]**. Some of their notable contributions include:\n- **[Example of achievement or responsibility, e.g., \"Leading a successful project that improved efficiency by 20%\"]**\n- **[Another example, e.g., \"Mentoring junior team members and fostering a collaborative work environment\"]**\n- **[Additional strengths, e.g., \"Exhibiting exceptional attention to detail and a commitment to meeting deadlines\"]**\n\n[Applicant’s First Name] is a highly motivated and reliable professional who approaches challenges with creativity and resilience. Their strong work ethic, positive attitude, and ability to work well under pressure make them an asset to any team.\n\nI have no doubt that [Applicant’s First Name] will excel in their future endeavors and contribute meaningfully to your organization. Should you require any further information, please feel free to contact me at **[Your Email Address]** or **[Your Phone Number]**.\n\nSincerely,\n**[Your Full Name]**\n[Your Job Title]\n[Your Company/Organization Name]\n\n---\n**Applicant’s Contact Information:**\n**[Applicant’s Full Name]**\n[Applicant’s Current Job Title]\n[Current Employer’s Name]\n[Applicant’s Email Address]\n[Applicant’s Phone Number]",
